# NON-working holidays (US-Eastern) for /registry-check working-time HOT/COLD.
# One ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD) per non-comment line. Weekends (Sat/Sun) are auto-detected;
# list only holidays here. A listed date does NOT age a project (like a weekend), so the
# HOT/COLD cutoff "appropriately accounts for the holiday weekend" with no manual pin.
# Maintain as holidays approach. US market/federal calendar. Andrew-direct 2026-07-06.
#
# 2026 (remaining, from July):
2026-07-03   # Independence Day observed (July 4 falls on Saturday)
2026-09-07   # Labor Day
2026-11-26   # Thanksgiving
2026-12-25   # Christmas
